 "source": "void bubbleSort(int arr[], int n) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < n - i - 1; j++) {\n            if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {\n                int tmp = arr[j];\n                arr[j] = arr[j + 1];\n                arr[j + 1] = tmp;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int arr[] = {3, 1, 2, 5, 4};\n    bubbleSort(arr, 5);\n    return 0;\n}\n"
